    "sub_name": "世界經濟與科技產業",
    "sub_ename": "WORLD ECONOMY AND TECHNOLOGY INDUSTRY",
    "describe_ch": "本課程希望透過閱讀、影片欣賞、小組討論與專題報告等方式，協助學生瞭解世界經濟運作的原理以及科技產業發展的趨勢。",
    "describe_eh": "This course hopes to help students understand the principles of the operation of the world economy and the development trend of the technology industry through reading, video appreciation, group discussions and thematic  reports.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
